#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:1
#: db3689809ee0476f9de3e8cce74733d1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:3
#: 371ef5776d0548389aa47279e7ff42ca
msgid ""
"A public web application and a separate static documentation pipeline share "
"reviewed suite metadata without sharing private state."
msgstr ""
"Une application web publique et une chaine documentaire statique separee "
"partagent les metadonnees revisees de la suite sans partager d'etat prive."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:5
#: d96829a832234151a206955dfd8ae8ad
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flux de donnees"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:11
#: 2896bafde18d453b872e019e2f3ced82
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Provenance"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:13
#: cb269db848b24653b7aaa51e4e1089ef
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Consignez le commit du depot, la configuration, les identifiants d'entree, "
"la commande d'execution, l'emplacement de sortie et le resultat de "
"validation. Une capture seule n'est pas un artefact reproductible."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:15
#: daf5cea641a24256b916a306b41ddec5
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportement en cas d'echec"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:17
#: f426647595864d59919b8eacfca2b3c1
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"Une configuration absente, des dependances indisponibles, une entree "
"invalide et des tests echoues doivent rester visibles. L'outil ne doit pas "
"remplacer un echec par un succes invente."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:19
#: 54de5c1f85cf4a51aea22cab0794e22b
msgid "Companion layering"
msgstr "Companion layering"

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:21
#: c2d9a19a0a9146e5a74b583342dfb98d
msgid ""
"The companion keeps a sanitized persistent Hero Book projection separate "
"from the temporary Scholarium specialist surface. AlgoQuest remains the "
"canonical progression owner. Scholarium can inspect context and stage a "
"pointer-only return; it cannot consume a prompt, admit evidence, award a "
"Knowledge Token, or advance a milestone."
msgstr ""
"The companion keeps a sanitized persistent Hero Book projection separate "
"from the temporary Scholarium specialist surface. AlgoQuest remains the "
"canonical progression owner. Scholarium can inspect context and stage a "
"pointer-only return; it cannot consume a prompt, admit evidence, award a "
"Knowledge Token, or advance a milestone."

#: ../../docs/tools/scholarium/architecture.md:23
#: 5342f5d0b8c344c1bf6139b06388931f
msgid ""
"The browser bridge reads the canonical manifest, registers descriptors only "
"when `document.modelContext` exists, and delegates to bounded same-origin "
"handlers. The shared MV3 side panel derives forms from those schemas and "
"applies a per-product theme without changing its information architecture."
msgstr ""
"The browser bridge reads the canonical manifest, registers descriptors only "
"when `document.modelContext` exists, and delegates to bounded same-origin "
"handlers. The shared MV3 side panel derives forms from those schemas and "
"applies a per-product theme without changing its information architecture."
